{"title":"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A rectangle has a perimeter of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0d6c36fdad9c2874053be46c7e4120f2edcf47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$42$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> and a width of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>What is its length?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/f/6cf4117e73aece1294c09392203c5dd15122093e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 19 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 17 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 34 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 21 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 38$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Perimeter\" title=\"Perimeter\">perimeter</a> of a rectangle is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/3/4a3f1692d694ecfe200242304a34ea4999dd8a06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2l + 2w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/e/f7efb39a18b227ecf2cc521a39dd15b309a5151d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2l + 2w = p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is the perimeter of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Rectangle\" title=\"Rectangle\">rectangle</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b25f8e64b484493fda944d25cad453423041fe6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l$\" width=\"5\" height=\"12\" /> is the rectangle's length, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> is the rectangle's width. However, the problem gives us that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/c/7acc91b00b1bec70f68bf71e3170b4a117533071.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/1/ca13767301d3e149fc3b1f4123d04fdaa69c60a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = 42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"17\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/f/c0f0f221bc4a39733c3ee6f2cf074b5f18373b71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2l + 2 \\times 4 = 42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"122\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/4/71469e5e6f75e612297684fbe7006e72bbcbd95e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2l + 8 = 42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d620777038003080ea45261385f25672839442e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2l = 42 - 8 = 34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"133\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/8/6c8077616e6da7382f45fe33c4d31e62b6cbb53a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"96\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1